"{\"title\":\"Mini Wars Buildings — Complete Database & Build-Order Codex · Mini Wars Wiki\",\"url\":\"/buildings\",\"h1\":\"MINI WARS BUILDINGS\",\"mainHTML\":\"<main class=\\\"relative z-10 flex-1\\\"><section class=\\\"relative border-b border-camo-900/80 bg-bunker-950/40 overflow-hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-50\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-20 -right-20 h-60 w-60 rounded-full bg-ember-500/10 blur-3xl\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-14 md:py-20\\\"><div class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-ember-500 mb-3 flex items-center gap-3\\\"><span class=\\\"h-px w-8 bg-ember-500\\\"></span>DATABASE · BLD</div><h1 class=\\\"font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Mini Wars Buildings</h1><p class=\\\"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base md:text-lg text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed\\\">The complete Mini Wars building list, sorted by category and unlock stage. The order you place these in is the difference between an early elimination and a top-board finish — read the tier and the tips, not just the stats.</p><div class=\\\"mt-6\\\"><div class=\\\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-ember-700/70 text-ember-300\\\">21<!-- --> entries</span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">S-tier · <!-- -->7</span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">Live Build</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\\\"relative border-b border-camo-900/60 bg-bunker-950/40\\\"><div class=\\\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 md:py-14\\\"><div class=\\\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12\\\"><div class=\\\"lg:col-span-8 space-y-6\\\"><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-ember-500\\\">ABOUT THIS DATABASE</div><div class=\\\"prose-tactical text-base md:text-lg text-bunker-200 leading-relaxed space-y-4\\\"><p>This is the complete <strong>Mini Wars buildings</strong> database for the Roblox country-conquest game by Horangi99. Every placeable structure is documented here — from the <!-- -->21<!-- -->-entry roster of resource farms, refineries, military bases, and the endgame<!-- --> <a class=\\\"text-ember-400 underline-offset-2 hover:underline\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/black-hole-generator\\\">Black Hole Generator</a>. Cards are sorted by category and unlock stage so you can read this page top-to-bottom as a build order.</p><p>If you only have time for one section, jump to<!-- --> <a href=\\\"#cat-resource\\\" class=\\\"text-ember-400 underline-offset-2 hover:underline\\\">Resource buildings</a> <!-- -->first — those decide your tempo for the entire run. Then plan your S-tier slots using the<!-- --> <a class=\\\"text-ember-400 underline-offset-2 hover:underline\\\" href=\\\"/tier-list\\\">Mini Wars tier list</a>, and pick a build order from the<!-- --> <a class=\\\"text-ember-400 underline-offset-2 hover:underline\\\" href=\\\"/strategy\\\">strategies page</a> <!-- -->to see how these buildings combine into a winning archetype.</p></div><div class=\\\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 pt-4\\\"><div class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner-sm p-5 bg-bunker-900/40\\\"><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-lg uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 mb-2\\\">Build order priority</h2><div class=\\\"text-sm text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed space-y-2\\\"><p><span class=\\\"text-sand-100\\\">Stage 1 (0-3 min)</span>: Farmhouse → Wheat Farm → Carrot Farm → first Workshop. No exceptions, no military yet.</p><p><span class=\\\"text-sand-100\\\">Stage 2 (3-8 min)</span>: Storage Center, Bank, second Workshop, first Barracks for population scaling.</p><p><span class=\\\"text-sand-100\\\">Stage 3 (8 min+)</span>: Pivot to your archetype — Air Base for rush, Oil Rig + Steel Mill for industrial scaling, or Bunker for turtle.</p></div></div><div class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner-sm p-5 bg-bunker-900/40\\\"><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-lg uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 mb-2\\\">How buildings interlock</h2><div class=\\\"text-sm text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed space-y-2\\\"><p>Buildings in Mini Wars are not standalone — they form chains. Carrot Farm → Workshop → Storage Center is the Economy chain. Oil Rig → Steel Mill → Air Base is the Industrial chain.</p><p>Read the<!-- --> <a class=\\\"text-ember-400 underline-offset-2 hover:underline\\\" href=\\\"/systems\\\">game systems</a> <!-- -->page to understand which chains feed which win conditions.</p></div></div></div></div><aside class=\\\"lg:col-span-4\\\"><div class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner p-5 bg-bunker-900/40 sticky top-24\\\"><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-ember-500 mb-4\\\">Jump to category</div><ul class=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\"><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"#cat-resource\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Resource</span></a></li><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"#cat-production\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Production</span></a></li><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"#cat-population\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Population</span></a></li><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"#cat-economy\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Economy</span></a></li><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"#cat-utility\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Utility</span></a></li><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"#cat-defense\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Defense</span></a></li><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"#cat-military\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Military</span></a></li><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/tier-list\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Tier list</span></a></li><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/strategy\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Build orders</span></a></li></ul></div></aside></div></div></section><div class=\\\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 space-y-14\\\"><section id=\\\"cat-resource\\\" class=\\\"scroll-mt-24\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-ember-500 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\\\"><span class=\\\"h-px w-6 bg-ember-500\\\"></span>Resource</div><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Mini Wars <!-- -->Resource<!-- --> Buildings</h2></div><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 whitespace-nowrap\\\">3<!-- --> entries</span></div><p class=\\\"text-sm text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-5\\\">Raw input generators — wheat, carrots, oil, steel. Place these first; nothing else works without resource flow.</p><div class=\\\"stencil-line mb-6\\\"></div><div class=\\\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\\\"><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/farmhouse\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">ECO-01<!-- --> · <!-- -->Early</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Farmhouse</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-C h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">C</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">The starter resource node. Generates a slow trickle of crops that you sell at the Clerk's Shop for your first cash injection. Replace it the moment you can afford a real factory — never hoard farmhouses.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Resource</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Opening</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Tutorial</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Cheap · starter tier</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/wheat-farm\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">ECO-02<!-- --> · <!-- -->Early</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Wheat Farm</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-C h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">C</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">Bigger, faster wheat output than the Farmhouse. The backbone of your first 5 minutes — but a dead end past Mid game. The only correct move once your economy stabilises is to sell it and rebuild on the slot.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Resource</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Early income</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Crop chaining</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Cheap · early tier</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/carrot-farm\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">ECO-03<!-- --> · <!-- -->Early</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Carrot Farm</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-B h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">B</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">Carrots sell for noticeably more than wheat. The moment a Carrot Farm slot is open, take it — it scales income faster than stacking more Wheat Farms ever will.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Resource</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Early-Mid pivot</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Income scaling</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Moderate · early-mid tier</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a></div></section><section id=\\\"cat-production\\\" class=\\\"scroll-mt-24\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-ember-500 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\\\"><span class=\\\"h-px w-6 bg-ember-500\\\"></span>Production</div><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Mini Wars <!-- -->Production<!-- --> Buildings</h2></div><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 whitespace-nowrap\\\">5<!-- --> entries</span></div><p class=\\\"text-sm text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-5\\\">Convert raw resources into refined output. Workshops, mills, and the rigs that bridge to military assets.</p><div class=\\\"stencil-line mb-6\\\"></div><div class=\\\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\\\"><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/wood-plant\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">IND-01<!-- --> · <!-- -->Early</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Wood Plant</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-B h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">B</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">The transition out of pure crops and into industry. Wood is a reliable mid-tier sell on the Market and the prerequisite mindset shift for everything that comes after — factories beat farms.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Production</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Mid-game pivot</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Civilian-driven income</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Moderate · mid tier</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/workshop\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">INF-01<!-- --> · <!-- -->Early</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Workshop</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-S h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">S</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">Each Workshop adds a builder to your roster. More builders means everything in your country goes up faster, including military buildings during wartime. The first Workshop is the single highest-impact purchase in the entire early game.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Production</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Tempo</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Build speed</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Cheap · priority buy</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/storage-center\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">INF-02<!-- --> · <!-- -->Early</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Storage Center</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-S h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">S</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">Auto-collects production from every nearby factory and farm. Place it in the middle of your industrial cluster and you stop wasting time clicking. The hidden multiplier on every building you own.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Production</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Automation</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Click-saving</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Moderate · core infrastructure</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/oil-rig\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">IND-04<!-- --> · <!-- -->Mid</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Oil Rig</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-A h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">A</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">A heavy-industry production node. Oil sells reasonably well on the Market, but its real value is as the upstream input for your military complex. Skipping the Oil Rig caps how many late-game units you can field at once, no matter how much money you stockpile.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Production</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Military supply</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Mid-late industry</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Expensive · mid-late industry</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/steel-mill\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">IND-03<!-- --> · <!-- -->Mid</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Steel Mill</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-A h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">A</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">Refines raw inputs into Steel — the prerequisite material for every advanced military building, from Tank Bases to Missile Launchers. Without a Steel Mill in your chain, your military caps out at Barracks and Border Towers.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Production</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Military supply</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Mid-game pivot</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Expensive · mid industry</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a></div></section><section id=\\\"cat-population\\\" class=\\\"scroll-mt-24\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-ember-500 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\\\"><span class=\\\"h-px w-6 bg-ember-500\\\"></span>Population</div><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Mini Wars <!-- -->Population<!-- --> Buildings</h2></div><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 whitespace-nowrap\\\">1<!-- --> entries</span></div><p class=\\\"text-sm text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-5\\\">Grow your civilian roster. Population gates how many soldiers, drivers, and operators you can field.</p><div class=\\\"stencil-line mb-6\\\"></div><div class=\\\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\\\"><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/houses\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">POP-01<!-- --> · <!-- -->Early</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Houses</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-A h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">A</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">Each House you own raises your civilian cap. More civilians means more factory throughput, which means more money, which means more military. Houses are the silent backbone of every successful run.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Population</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Population cap</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Factory staffing</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Cheap → scales</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a></div></section><section id=\\\"cat-economy\\\" class=\\\"scroll-mt-24\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-ember-500 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\\\"><span class=\\\"h-px w-6 bg-ember-500\\\"></span>Economy</div><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Mini Wars <!-- -->Economy<!-- --> Buildings</h2></div><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 whitespace-nowrap\\\">3<!-- --> entries</span></div><p class=\\\"text-sm text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-5\\\">Cash and storage. Markets, vaults, and Storage Centers that decide whether your wealth survives a raid.</p><div class=\\\"stencil-line mb-6\\\"></div><div class=\\\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\\\"><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/nuclear-reactor\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">ECO-08<!-- --> · <!-- -->Late</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Nuclear Reactor</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-S h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">S</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">The economic milestone that signals you have officially graduated from farms. Reliable, dense, high-throughput income. If you have at least two of these running, you are in the top half of every server you join.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Economy</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Late income</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Multiplier core</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Expensive · late tier</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/data-center\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">ECO-09<!-- --> · <!-- -->Late</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Data Center</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-S h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">S</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">Returns rival Nuclear Reactors in raw output, with a slightly different consumption profile. Running both is intentional — they smooth income variance and remove the Market timing tax.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Economy</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Stable late income</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Civilian utilisation</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Expensive · late tier</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/black-hole-generator\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">ECO-MAX<!-- --> · <!-- -->Endgame</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Black Hole Generator</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-S h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">S</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">The highest income source in Mini War. A single Black Hole Generator outpaces a stack of Reactors. The endgame flex — and the only econ building worth defending with your full military.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Economy</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Endgame</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Trophy build</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Endgame · save for the long haul</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a></div></section><section id=\\\"cat-utility\\\" class=\\\"scroll-mt-24\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-ember-500 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\\\"><span class=\\\"h-px w-6 bg-ember-500\\\"></span>Utility</div><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Mini Wars <!-- -->Utility<!-- --> Buildings</h2></div><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 whitespace-nowrap\\\">3<!-- --> entries</span></div><p class=\\\"text-sm text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-5\\\">Quality-of-life buildings — builders, dispatchers, and infrastructure that compress your build time.</p><div class=\\\"stencil-line mb-6\\\"></div><div class=\\\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\\\"><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/clerks-shop\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">MKT-01<!-- --> · <!-- -->Early</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Clerk's Shop</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-A h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">A</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">Your sell point. Crops, wood, and steel turn into money here — but only at the price the Market is offering right now. Learning to time the Clerk's Shop is the single biggest skill ceiling in the game and a multiplier on every other building you own.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Utility</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Cashing out</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Market timing</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Cheap · always-on</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/worker-statue\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">BUF-01<!-- --> · <!-- -->Early</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Worker Statue</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-A h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">A</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">A flat speed buff for every worker in radius. Place it next to your factory cluster and watch every farm and plant tick noticeably faster. Most new players never build one. They should.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Utility</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Output speed</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Hidden tempo</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Cheap · multiplier</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/soldier-statue\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">BUF-02<!-- --> · <!-- -->Mid</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Soldier Statue</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-A h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">A</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">The military counterpart of the Worker Statue. Inspires nearby troops to deal more damage in defensive engagements. A must-have for anyone holding a chokepoint.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Utility</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Defense</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Damage buff</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Cheap · multiplier</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a></div></section><section id=\\\"cat-defense\\\" class=\\\"scroll-mt-24\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-ember-500 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\\\"><span class=\\\"h-px w-6 bg-ember-500\\\"></span>Defense</div><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Mini Wars <!-- -->Defense<!-- --> Buildings</h2></div><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 whitespace-nowrap\\\">2<!-- --> entries</span></div><p class=\\\"text-sm text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-5\\\">Walls, turrets, and the Bunker. Cheap insurance against Air Rush and ground raids.</p><div class=\\\"stencil-line mb-6\\\"></div><div class=\\\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\\\"><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/border-tower\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">DEF-01<!-- --> · <!-- -->Early</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Border Tower</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-B h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">B</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">A flat early-game guard against opportunistic raiders. Will not stop a real military push, but will make solo invaders think twice — and that is enough during the first 10 minutes.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Defense</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Early defense</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Civilian protection</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Cheap · early defense</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/bunker\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">DEF-02<!-- --> · <!-- -->Mid</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Bunker</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-A h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">A</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">A hardened defensive structure that can garrison soldiers and absorb significantly more damage than a Border Tower. The Bunker is the difference between losing your civilians on the first raid and watching the attacker break themselves on your perimeter.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Defense</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Hard defense</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Civilian protection</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Expensive · core defense</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a></div></section><section id=\\\"cat-military\\\" class=\\\"scroll-mt-24\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-ember-500 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\\\"><span class=\\\"h-px w-6 bg-ember-500\\\"></span>Military</div><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Mini Wars <!-- -->Military<!-- --> Buildings</h2></div><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 whitespace-nowrap\\\">4<!-- --> entries</span></div><p class=\\\"text-sm text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-5\\\">Offensive force. Barracks, Air Bases, and the Black Hole Generator — your win-condition slots.</p><div class=\\\"stencil-line mb-6\\\"></div><div class=\\\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\\\"><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/barracks\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">MIL-01<!-- --> · <!-- -->Early</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Barracks</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-A h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">A</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">In Mini Wars the Barracks is a dual-purpose building: it produces civilians on a passive timer (the real backbone of your population) and it can also train those civilians into ground soldiers when war breaks out. Skipping the Barracks does not just delay your military — it caps your entire economy, because no civilians means no factory throughput.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Military</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Population growth</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Early military</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Moderate · core early-game pickup</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/tank-base\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">MIL-04<!-- --> · <!-- -->Mid</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Tank Base</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-A h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">A</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">Ground armor for territory raids. Tanks are the workhorse of any invasion plan that does not lean entirely on aircraft. Slower than air, but cheaper, tougher, and harder to counter.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Military</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Ground invasion</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Territory raids</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Expensive · mid military</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/air-base\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">MIL-05<!-- --> · <!-- -->Mid</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Air Base · Black Hawks</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-S h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">S</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">Black Hawks deployed from the Air Base are the single strongest invasion tool in the current build. Fast, lethal against most defended bases, and the core of every winning offensive composition.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Military</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Invasion</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Conquest</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Expensive · meta pick</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\\\"group relative flex flex-col hud-frame clip-corner overflow-hidden p-5 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings/missile-launcher\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-ember-500/5 blur-2xl group-hover:bg-ember-500/15 transition-colors\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-3\\\"><div><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-400 mb-1.5\\\">MIL-06<!-- --> · <!-- -->Mid</div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 group-hover:text-ember-400 transition-colors leading-tight\\\">Missile Launcher</h3></div><span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold border clip-corner-sm tier-S h-8 w-8 text-sm\\\">S</span></div><p class=\\\"relative mt-1 text-sm text-bunker-300 line-clamp-3\\\">High-damage long-range fire support. Missile Launchers are what turn a Black Hawk wave from a skirmish into an actual conquest. Run them in pairs — one alone gets sniped before it does enough damage.</p><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/70 text-camo-200\\\">Military</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Invasion</span><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-700 text-bunker-300\\\">Defense</span></div><div class=\\\"relative mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-camo-800/70 pt-3 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\"><span>Expensive · meta pick</span><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-camo-500 group-hover:text-ember-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 7h10v10\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M7 17 17 7\\\"></path></svg></div></a></div></section><div class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner p-6 md:p-8 bg-bunker-900/40\\\"><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 mb-4\\\">Use the Mini Wars buildings list with</h2><div class=\\\"grid gap